{60}{I don't require anything fancy, Just 500 coins, and you must be ready to learn. I think you need some more experience before I will taking any of your money, though. Come on back when you are ready.}{I don't require anything fancy, Just 500 coins, and you must be ready to learn. I think you need some more experience before I will taking any of your money, though. Come on back when you are ready.}{}{}{}{}
