{198}{Chambers was blinded in a duel with Garrick Stout. Chambers was defending the honor of his betrothed...a beautiful and virtuous woman know as Lady Druella. The details are shameful to me and I will not speak of them. Trial by combat proved Stout's innocence, as he was victorious. However, he disgraced himself by attacking after his opponent had yielded.}{Chambers was blinded in a duel with Garrick Stout. Chambers was defending the honor of his betrothed...a beautiful and virtuous woman know as Lady Druella. The details are shameful to me and I will not speak of them. Trial by combat proved Stout's innocence, as he was victorious. However, he disgraced himself by attacking after his opponent had yielded.}{}{}{}{}
