{209}{Incredible as it may seem, the dodge master is a blind hermit named Adkin Chambers. He was blinded and disfigured in a duel, by an unchivalrous blow that was delivered after he had yielded. Such things are expected in war, but not in a trial of arms. Now he hides himself from society on the outskirts of Stillwater.}{Incredible as it may seem, the dodge master is a blind hermit named Adkin Chambers. He was blinded and disfigured in a duel, by an unchivalrous blow that was delivered after he had yielded. Such things are expected in war, but not in a trial of arms. Now he hides himself from society on the outskirts of Stillwater.}{}{}{}{ru 2163}
