{227}{He is a crass man. Unchivalrous and lecherous in his affairs. If abandoning all that is pure and good is the consequence of mastery, then I shall never pursue it. I could learn nothing from such a man. He still lives in Dernholm, I believe they have made him Captain of the Guard. I can remember when that position was held by honorable men. Disgusting....}{He is a crass man. Unchivalrous and lecherous in his affairs. If abandoning all that is pure and good is the consequence of mastery, then I shall never pursue it. I could learn nothing from such a man. He still lives in Dernholm, I believe they have made him Captain of the Guard. I can remember when that position was held by honorable men. Disgusting....}{}{}{}{}
